	(106933, 1230865, 'tatoeba', '苦労するよ。', 'You\'ll have a hard time.'),
	(106934, 179515, 'tatoeba', '苦労なしに栄光はない。', 'No cross, no crown.'),
	(106935, 10771189, 'tatoeba', '折角ここまで頑張って積み上げたのに、もう崩すの？もったいない！', 'After all that effort to build it up, you\'re already going to knock it down? What a waste!'),
	(106936, 76348, 'tatoeba', '一族が苦労して積み上げてきたものを、お前は一瞬で反故にするつもりか。', 'Do you intend to throw away in one instant what our family has painstakingly built up?'),
	(106937, 10153663, 'tatoeba', '指を開いて。', 'Spread your fingers.'),
	(106938, 10603310, 'tatoeba', '指をなめるな。', 'Don\'t lick your fingers.'),
	(106939, 79887, 'tatoeba', '目薬をください。', 'I\'d like to buy eye drops.'),
	(106940, 9963912, 'tatoeba', '目薬を点すのを忘れてた。', 'I forgot to put drops into my eyes.'),
	(106941, 76349, 'tatoeba', '一生懸命指でまぶたを広げて目薬を差しました。', 'With great effort I held his eyelids open with my fingers and dropped in the eye medicine.'),
	(106942, 76351, 'tatoeba', '一子ちゃんは同じ穴のムジナか、同輩の親しみを込めた笑みを俺に向ける。', 'I guess Ichiko is a fellow rule-breaker, she\'s sending me a smile filled with affection for a comrade.'),
	(106943, 107814, 'tatoeba', '彼は穴を掘った。', 'He dug a hole.'),
	(106944, 101988, 'tatoeba', '彼は庭に穴を掘った。', 'He dug a hole in the garden.'),
	(106945, 211138, 'tatoeba', 'その穴をふさごうよ。', 'Let\'s plug up the hole.'),
	(106946, 866745, 'tatoeba', '私は彼に親しみを込めた返事を書いた。', 'I wrote him a friendly reply.'),
	(106947, 87391, 'tatoeba', '彼女は彼に親しみを込めた手紙を書き、彼の援助に感謝した。', 'She wrote him a friendly letter, and thanked him for his help.'),
	(106948, 145583, 'tatoeba', '心を込めて祈りなさい。', 'Pray with all your heart.'),
	(106949, 172983, 'tatoeba', '黒雲が垂れ込めていた。', 'Dark clouds were brooding over the city.'),
	(106950, 89007, 'tatoeba', '彼女は自分の声に熱意を込めようとした。', 'She tried to put energy into her voice.'),
	(106951, 189164, 'tatoeba', '英語の発音の呼吸がなかなか飲み込めない。', 'I still can\'t get the knack of English pronunciation.'),
	(106952, 116124, 'tatoeba', '彼の本には未来の世界への理想が込められている。', 'There is a vision of the future world in his books.'),
	(106953, 94748, 'tatoeba', '彼女のいったことには悪意は込められていなかった。', 'There was no malice intended in what she said.'),
	(106954, 10682297, 'tatoeba', 'トムは満面の笑みだったよ。', 'Tom was smiling from ear to ear.'),
	(106955, 12281003, 'tatoeba', '間違えた。', 'I made a mistake.'),
	(106956, 2312024, 'tatoeba', '間違えました。', 'I made a mistake.'),
	(106957, 10066675, 'tatoeba', '間違えてるよ。', 'You\'ve made a mistake.'),
	(106958, 13127483, 'tatoeba', 'よく間違えます。', 'We often make mistakes.'),
	(106959, 1015158, 'tatoeba', '間違えちゃった。', 'I made a mistake.'),
	(106960, 9941610, 'tatoeba', '私、よく間違えるの。', 'I often make mistakes.'),
	(106961, 121171, 'tatoeba', '番号をお間違えです。', 'You\'ve got the wrong number.'),
	(106962, 101981, 'tatoeba', '彼は弟と間違えられた。', 'He was mistaken for his younger brother.'),
	(106963, 10901447, 'tatoeba', '大胆不敵ね。', 'You\'re fearless.'),
	(106964, 102377, 'tatoeba', '彼は大胆なことを言う。', 'He says daring things.'),
	(106965, 10901448, 'tatoeba', 'トムは大胆不敵でした。', 'Tom was fearless.'),
	(106966, 76356, 'tatoeba', '椅子とかテーブルとかの搬入はどうするの？', 'What will we do about getting tables, chairs and such?'),
	(106967, 393833, 'tatoeba', '内閣が触れを回した。', 'The Cabinet sent round an official notice.'),
	(106968, 123239, 'tatoeba', '内閣は辞職するそうだ。', 'They say the Cabinet will resign.'),
	(106969, 76358, 'tatoeba', '安倍内閣は、自由民主党、公明党を与党とする連立内閣である。', 'The Abe Cabinet is a coalition Cabinet where the Liberal Democratic Party and New Komei Party form the government.'),
	(106970, 100432, 'tatoeba', '彼は富を築いた。', 'He heaped up a fortune.'),
	(106971, 100434, 'tatoeba', '彼は富を蓄えた。', 'He has accumulated wealth.'),
	(106972, 2556040, 'tatoeba', '私は公平だ。', 'I\'m fair.'),
	(106973, 173987, 'tatoeba', '公平にやろうぜ！', 'Fair does!'),
	(106974, 2573227, 'tatoeba', '私は公平ではない。', 'I\'m biased.'),
	(106975, 96048, 'tatoeba', '彼らは利益を公平に分配した。', 'They allotted the profits fairly.'),
	(106976, 170227, 'tatoeba', '財産は３人兄弟の間で分配された。', 'The fortune was divided among the three brothers.'),
	(106977, 142131, 'tatoeba', '赤十字は被災者に食料と医療を分配した。', 'The Red Cross dispensed food and medical supplies to the victims.'),
	(106978, 9086491, 'tatoeba', '昨夜ね、やな夢見たんだ。', 'I had a bad dream last night.'),
	(106979, 8867106, 'tatoeba', '夢見てるみたいな気分だよ。', 'I feel like I\'m dreaming.'),
	(106980, 110427, 'tatoeba', '彼はよく一攫千金を夢見ている。', 'He often tries to get rich at a single bound.'),
	(106981, 3658126, 'tatoeba', 'この日が来るのを夢見ていました。', 'I\'ve dreamed of this day.'),
	(106982, 138352, 'tatoeba', '多くの人が一攫千金を夢見て宝くじを買う。', 'A lot of people buy lotteries dreaming of wealth at one stroke.'),
	(106983, 3658125, 'tatoeba', '彼女はバレリーナになりたいと夢見ていた。', 'She dreamed of becoming a ballerina.'),
	(106984, 3569917, 'tatoeba', '「変な夢見た」「どんな夢？」', '"That was a strange dream." "What happened?"'),
	(106985, 110707, 'tatoeba', '彼はまるで夢見ているような感じだった。', 'He felt as if he were in a dream.'),
	(106986, 76361, 'tatoeba', 'わたしのテクに抜かりはないわ。', 'My technique is without flaw.'),
	(106987, 76362, 'tatoeba', 'わたしが前をよく見てなかったから、出会い頭にぶつかっちゃって。小川くんは悪くないわ。', 'Because I wasn\'t looking where I was going, I bumped into him when we passed. It wasn\'t his fault.'),
	(106988, 76363, 'tatoeba', 'わずかなヒントを糸口にして、正しいこたえを見つけた。', 'He took a slight hint as the start and found the correct answer.'),
	(106989, 173443, 'tatoeba', '考古学者とは昔の民族の生活様式についての糸口を捜し求める人達である。', 'Archaeologists are those who hunt for clues about the lifestyles of ancient peoples.'),
	(106990, 200551, 'tatoeba', 'とても魅力的な人に初めて会って、話の糸口を見つけるのは、たいていかなり難しいものだ。', 'People usually find it very difficult to break the ice when they meet someone extremely attractive for the first time.'),
	(106991, 2521027, 'tatoeba', 'トムは舌が肥えている。', 'Tom is particular about what he eats.'),
	(106992, 85839, 'tatoeba', '肥えた鶏は卵を産まない。', 'Fat hens lay few eggs.'),
	(106993, 76364, 'tatoeba', 'ロビンは口が肥えて贅沢になったのかしら。', 'Perhaps Robin\'s got a taste for the finer things in life and has become extravagant.'),
	(106994, 2513932, 'tatoeba', 'ここの人たちは舌が肥えていますから、安くてもまずい店はすぐにつぶれてしまうんですよ。', 'The people here are particular about what they eat, so even if a restaurant is inexpensive, it\'ll soon go out of business if the food doesn\'t taste good.'),
	(106995, 116373, 'tatoeba', '彼の農場の土はとても肥えている。', 'The land on his farm is very fertile.'),
	(106996, 85838, 'tatoeba', '肥えた人は概してよく汗をかく。', 'Fat people generally sweat a lot.'),
	(106997, 9360127, 'tatoeba', '彼らの畜牛はみなよく肥えている。', 'Their cattle are all fat.'),
	(106998, 121706, 'tatoeba', '農業には肥えた土地が不可欠だ。', 'Fertile soil is indispensable for agriculture.'),
	(106999, 11638334, 'tatoeba', 'トムは贅沢三昧だ。', 'Tom lives in the lap of luxury.'),
	(107000, 98819, 'tatoeba', '彼は贅沢な生活を送った。', 'He led a life of luxury.'),
	(107001, 121204, 'tatoeba', '犯人は人質を解放しなかった。', 'The criminal didn\'t let the hostages go.'),
	(107002, 10987667, 'tatoeba', '犠牲はつきものさ。', 'Sacrifices are inevitable.'),
	(107003, 77821, 'tatoeba', '良心を犠牲にして富を得るな。', 'Don\'t obtain wealth at the expense of your conscience.'),
	(107004, 105238, 'tatoeba', '彼は自ら野心の犠牲になった。', 'He fell victim to his own ambition.'),
	(107005, 174254, 'tatoeba', '御尊父の死に謹んで哀悼の意を表します。', 'Please accept our condolences on the death of your father.'),
	(107006, 165995, 'tatoeba', '私たちは皆事故による死者に哀悼の意を表した。', 'We all mourned for the people killed in the accident.'),
	(107007, 217075, 'tatoeba', 'ご尊父のご逝去に対し、謹んで哀悼の意を表します。', 'Please accept my condolences on the death of your father.'),
	(107008, 146887, 'tatoeba', '小麦粉はパンになる。', 'Flour is made into bread.'),
	(107009, 1192221, 'tatoeba', '小麦粉を棚に入れて。', 'Put the flour on the shelf.'),
	(107010, 197739, 'tatoeba', 'パンは小麦粉で作られる。', 'Bread is made from flour.'),
	(107011, 170613, 'tatoeba', '最近遅刻の回数が増えている。', 'You\'ve been late for school more often than before.'),
	(107012, 228735, 'tatoeba', 'いつもより尿の回数が多いです。', 'I urinate more often than usual.'),
	(107013, 229327, 'tatoeba', 'いい匂い。', 'It smells good!'),
	(107014, 10759886, 'tatoeba', '何の匂い？', 'What\'s that smell?'),
	(107015, 11464830, 'tatoeba', 'いい匂いね。', 'That smells really good.'),
	(107016, 150791, 'tatoeba', '事情はこの通りです。', 'This is the case.'),
	(107017, 174340, 'tatoeba', '事情は後で説明する。', 'I will explain the situation to you later on.'),
	(107018, 219890, 'tatoeba', 'この別荘の持ち主は誰ですか。', 'Who owns this villa?'),
	(107019, 90753, 'tatoeba', '彼女は海辺に別荘を持っている。', 'She has a cottage by the sea.'),
	(107020, 2869728, 'tatoeba', 'トムは男手一つで3人の子供を育てた。', 'Tom raised three children all by himself.'),
	(107021, 76381, 'tatoeba', 'やっぱり男手があると、作業の幅が広がるねぇ。', 'When there\'s a man around, the work that can be done sure increases.'),
	(107022, 208489, 'tatoeba', 'その川は幅が広い。', 'The river is wide.'),
	(107023, 83895, 'tatoeba', '幅はどれくらいですか。', 'How wide is it?'),
	(107024, 82437, 'tatoeba', '北海道の道路は幅が広い。', 'The streets in Hokkaido are wide.'),
	(107025, 235195, 'tatoeba', '４年以上も音信不通だったんだよ。', 'I haven\'t heard a word from them in over four years.'),
	(107026, 76385, 'tatoeba', 'もし音信不通になったら警察に連絡してね。', 'If I drop out of contact, let the police know, OK?'),
	(107027, 124683, 'tatoeba', '電話は不通なの。', 'The phones aren\'t working.'),
	(107028, 174167, 'tatoeba', '交通が全く不通になっている。', 'Traffic is all tied up.'),
	(107029, 126895, 'tatoeba', '地震で鉄道の運行が不通になった。', 'The train service was suspended by the earthquake.'),
	(107030, 76388, 'tatoeba', 'もー、弥生のナビが判りにくいから、同じトコぐるぐる回ったじゃない。', 'Hmph, Yayoi\'s navigation was difficult to follow so we ended up going round and round the same places.'),
	(107031, 811768, 'tatoeba', '判ってきた。', 'I understand now.'),
	(107032, 1429388, 'tatoeba', '私だって判らない。', 'Even I don\'t understand.'),
	(107033, 215453, 'tatoeba', 'ジョンの事業はまったくの失敗であると判った。', 'John\'s business has turned out to be a complete failure.'),
	(107034, 869812, 'tatoeba', 'これは女王アリだね。羽が生えているのが判るだろう？', 'This ant is the queen; don\'t you see she has wings?'),
	(107035, 185448, 'tatoeba', '会ってみるまで本当に人柄は判らない。', 'You do not really understand a man till you have met him.'),
	(107036, 3052228, 'tatoeba', '暗がりではっきり見えなかったが、娘の顔が半泣きらしいことは声で判った。', 'He could not see well in the dark, but from the sound of her voice he could tell that the girl was on the verge of tears.'),
	(107037, 869875, 'tatoeba', '私は机に書き置きを見つけたが、誰が書いたものか判らない。', 'I noticed a note on my desk, but I do not know who wrote it.'),
	(107038, 11257893, 'tatoeba', '伺います。', 'We\'ll visit you.'),
	(107039, 83085, 'tatoeba', '母はお伺いできません。', 'My mother can\'t come.'),
	(107040, 227401, 'tatoeba', 'お噂は伺っております。', 'I\'ve heard a lot about you.'),
	(107041, 80629, 'tatoeba', '明日伺ってもいいですか。', 'May I come and see you tomorrow?'),
	(107042, 217052, 'tatoeba', 'ご伝言を伺いましょうか。', 'Can I take a message?'),
	(107043, 3583188, 'tatoeba', '仕事上の面会に伺いました。', 'I have come to see you on business.'),
	(107044, 233456, 'tatoeba', 'あなたの噂は伺っています。', 'I\'ve heard about you.'),
	(107045, 10240167, 'tatoeba', 'いつならお伺いできますか？', 'When can I visit you?'),
	(107046, 76391, 'tatoeba', 'もう、そんな顔をするなら、またただの友達に格下げするわよ。', 'Oh, you! If you go around with a face like that, I\'ll have to demote you back down to \'friend\' again.'),
	(107047, 88433, 'tatoeba', '彼女は水面下にもぐった。', 'She sank under the surface of the water.'),
	(107048, 182120, 'tatoeba', '魚が水面から飛び上がった。', 'A fish leaped out of the water.'),
	(107049, 115433, 'tatoeba', '大統領には彼が適任だ。', 'He\'s eligible for the presidency.'),
	(107050, 1193450, 'tatoeba', 'その仕事に彼は適任だ。', 'He is adequate to the job.'),
	(107051, 113132, 'tatoeba', '彼はそのポストに適任だ。', 'He is adequate for the post.'),
	(107052, 2976593, 'tatoeba', 'バクテリアは肉眼では見えない。', 'Bacteria are invisible to the naked eye.'),
	(107053, 85581, 'tatoeba', '微粒子は肉眼ではほとんど見えない。', 'Minute particles are hardly visible to the naked eye.'),
	(107054, 122978, 'tatoeba', '肉眼ではほとんど見えない星もある。', 'Some stars are hardly visible to the naked eye.'),
	(107055, 11953093, 'tatoeba', 'トムは車のグローブボックスに双眼鏡を入れている。', 'Tom keeps a pair of binoculars in the glove compartment of his car.'),
	(107056, 76402, 'tatoeba', 'まだ肉眼じゃ無理だよ。双眼鏡だと、ちょびっとだけ見えるかも・・・。', 'It\'s still impossible with the naked eye. With binoculars you might be able to glimpse it....'),
	(107057, 147756, 'tatoeba', '出荷時をご連絡ください。', 'Would you please let me know the delivery time?'),
	(107058, 85223, 'tatoeba', '品物は昨日出荷されました。', 'The goods were sent out yesterday.'),
	(107059, 189989, 'tatoeba', '引き続き努力いたします。', 'I will continue with my efforts.'),
	(107060, 189990, 'tatoeba', '引き続きのご支援を感謝いたします。', 'We appreciate your continued support.'),
	(107061, 209966, 'tatoeba', 'その事件の展開について引き続きお知らせ下さい。', 'Please keep me informed of the development of the case.'),
	(107062, 143295, 'tatoeba', '成り行きに任せなさい。', 'Let things take their own course.'),
	(107063, 229689, 'tatoeba', 'あれは成り行きでした。', 'One thing led to another.'),
	(107064, 12698909, 'tatoeba', '自然な成り行きだった。', 'It was the natural outcome.'),
	(107065, 203621, 'tatoeba', 'ただ見守るばかりだった。', 'He could do nothing but watch.'),
	(107066, 102763, 'tatoeba', '彼は息を殺して見守った。', 'He watched it holding his breath.'),
	(107067, 221670, 'tatoeba', 'この事を注意して見守ろう。', 'Let\'s keep an eye on this.'),
	(107068, 230716, 'tatoeba', 'あの人は私の一挙一動を見守っている。', 'He is watching my every move.'),
	(107069, 144808, 'tatoeba', '親は子供の幸せを見守らなければならない。', 'Parents must look after the well-being of the their children.'),
	(107070, 232956, 'tatoeba', 'あなたの両親が私たちを見守ってくれました。', 'Your parents kept an eye on us.'),
	(107071, 165373, 'tatoeba', '私たちは日が地平線に沈んでいくのを見守っていた。', 'We watched the sun sinking below the horizon.'),
	(107072, 10069300, 'tatoeba', '誰かを見守れるのは、誰かが見守ってくれてるから。', 'I can take care of someone, because someone is taking care of me.'),
	(107073, 208701, 'tatoeba', 'その成功は君の努力の成果だ。', 'The success resulted from your efforts.'),
	(107074, 218326, 'tatoeba', 'これは私たちの研究の成果です。', 'This is the outcome of our research.'),
	(107075, 197464, 'tatoeba', 'ひと騒動起こしてやります。', 'I\'m going to rock the boat.'),
	(107076, 173028, 'tatoeba', '国民の怒りが噴出して騒動が繰り返された。', 'The anger of the people exploded, leading to a series of riots.'),
	(107077, 76410, 'tatoeba', 'まず、私の活動範囲は、おもに養老川下流域です。', 'First off, my area of work is mainly in the lower reaches of the Yourou River.'),
	(107078, 165526, 'tatoeba', '私たちは川下にある橋を渡って回り道をしなければならなかった。', 'We had to make a detour across a bridge down the river from here.'),
	(107079, 203273, 'tatoeba', 'ダムが切れて流域に大水が押し寄せた。', 'The dam gave way and sent a great flush of water down the valley.'),
	(107080, 175976, 'tatoeba', '激しい雨がその流域に洪水をもたらした。', 'The heavy rain brought floods in the valley.'),
	(107081, 106507, 'tatoeba', '彼は市長を務めた。', 'He served as mayor.'),
	(107082, 168334, 'tatoeba', '市長は市政を司る。', 'The mayor administers the affairs of the city.'),
	(107083, 106514, 'tatoeba', '彼は市長に選ばれた。', 'He was elected mayor.'),
	(107084, 156535, 'tatoeba', '私は市長に請願を出した。', 'I addressed a petition to the mayor.'),
	(107085, 142593, 'tatoeba', '請願が却下されたのはおかしいと思った。', 'I thought it strange that the petition had been turned down.'),
	(107086, 76411, 'tatoeba', 'まず、市長あてに、請願書を提出して、署名運動をしています。', 'First, we will present a petition to the mayor and collect signatures.'),
	(107087, 155942, 'tatoeba', '私は書類に署名した。', 'I attached my signature to the document.'),
	(107088, 104139, 'tatoeba', '彼は小切手に署名した。', 'He signed the check.'),
	(107089, 10721062, 'tatoeba', 'トムは義弟よ。', 'Tom is my younger sister\'s husband.'),
	(107090, 10715876, 'tatoeba', '義弟は、私より年上なのよ。', 'My brother-in-law is older than me.'),
	(107091, 76412, 'tatoeba', 'まさか惚れたんですか。認めん、認めんぞ。あの男を義弟になるなんて、僕は絶対いやです！', 'You haven\'t fallen in love, have you!? I won\'t have it! Having that man become my brother-in-law; I absolutely hate that!'),
	(107092, 76414, 'tatoeba', 'まさかリアルに借金の催促だったの？', 'No way, is this really a debt collection call?'),
	(107093, 216084, 'tatoeba', 'しびれを切らして借金の催促をした。', 'He impatiently asked for repayment.'),
	(107094, 170823, 'tatoeba', '催促がましくて恐縮ですが、先日お貸ししたお金を返していただけませんか。', 'I\'m afraid this sounds like a demand, but could you return the money I lent you the other day?'),
	(107095, 182369, 'tatoeba', '窮地から足掻き出る。', 'He will wriggle out of the fix.'),
	(107096, 208229, 'tatoeba', 'その大臣は不正取引によって窮地に立ちました。', 'The minister was in a fix over illegal dealings.'),
	(107097, 76415, 'tatoeba', 'まさかそのような窮地に立たされているとは露知らず。', 'Good grief! I had no idea you had been placed in such a tight spot.'),
	(107098, 994834, 'tatoeba', '悪露があった。', 'I had a lochia.'),
	(107099, 225260, 'tatoeba', '今朝は露が降りた。', 'The dew fell this morning.'),
	(107100, 4975912, 'tatoeba', '彼女の腰は細いです。', 'She has a slender waist.'),
	(107101, 10536835, 'tatoeba', 'トムは年の割に細かった。', 'Tom was small for his age.'),
	(107102, 222658, 'tatoeba', 'この回線の細さじゃ、動画は見られないよ。', 'This connection is too slow for me to watch movies.'),
