	(111583, 11556390, 'tatoeba', '雨でひまわり畑は台無しだ。', 'The rain destroyed the sunflower garden.'),
	(111584, 79900, 'tatoeba', '目先の利益だけにとらわれてはいけない。', 'You must not think about your immediate profit only.'),
