	(113224, 186243, 'tatoeba', '我々の世界は宇宙のほんの小さな一部分に過ぎない。', 'Our world is only one small part of the universe.'),
	(113225, 82443, 'tatoeba', '北海道に着き次第、一筆差し上げます。', 'As soon as I get to Hokkaido, I\'ll drop you a line.'),
	(113226, 173837, 'tatoeba', '向こうへついたらすぐに一筆便りを頼む。', 'Drop me a line as soon as you get there.'),
	(113227, 192130, 'tatoeba', 'ロンドンに着いたらきっと一筆お便りくださいね。', 'Be sure to drop us a line as soon as you get to London.'),
	(113228, 358441, 'tatoeba', '一遍で正確に答えてください。', 'Answer accurately in one go.'),
	(113229, 11529726, 'tatoeba', '一遍に2か国語も習ってるの？', 'Are you learning two foreign languages at the same time?'),
	(113230, 10842066, 'tatoeba', '一遍に二つのことはできないよ。', 'I can\'t do two things at a time.'),
	(113231, 82453, 'tatoeba', '北海の海底で石油が発見されている。', 'Oil has been discovered under the North Sea.'),
	(113232, 192626, 'tatoeba', 'ラジオによると、北海で嵐が起こるとのことだ。', 'According to the radio, a storm is imminent in the North.'),
	(113233, 141135, 'tatoeba', '船は海底に沈んだ。', 'The ship sank to the bottom of the sea.'),
	(113234, 141057, 'tatoeba', '船底が海底に当たった。', 'The ship touched ground.'),
	(113235, 171313, 'tatoeba', '今年は春の訪れが遅い。', 'Spring is late coming this year.'),
	(113236, 171315, 'tatoeba', '今年は春の訪れが早かった。', 'Spring has come early this year.'),
	(113237, 204964, 'tatoeba', 'それは道徳に反する。', 'It is contrary to the morals.'),
	(113238, 115766, 'tatoeba', '彼の話は事実に反する。', 'What he has said is contrary to fact.'),
	(113239, 11878833, 'tatoeba', 'これは車庫の鍵よ。', 'This is the key to the garage.'),
	(113240, 1147494, 'tatoeba', '車は車庫にあります。', 'The car is in the garage.'),
	(113241, 11922415, 'tatoeba', '車庫のドアが開いてる。', 'The garage door is open.'),
	(113242, 185253, 'tatoeba', '社会は個人から成り立っている。', 'The community is made up of individuals.'),
	(113243, 178013, 'tatoeba', '君の理論は成り立たないと思う。', 'I think your theory does not hold water.'),
	(113244, 219736, 'tatoeba', 'この本は３つの章から成り立っています。', 'This book is composed of three chapters.'),
	(113245, 208192, 'tatoeba', 'その団体は教師と学生から成り立っていた。', 'The group was made up of teachers and students.'),
	(113246, 182358, 'tatoeba', '給料があがったので生活がどうにか成り立つ。', 'Since I got a raise, I can manage.'),
	(113247, 142559, 'tatoeba', '青銅は銅とすずから成り立っている。', 'Bronze is composed of copper and tin.'),
	(113248, 220722, 'tatoeba', 'この組織は君無しには成り立たない。', 'This organization cannot exist without you.'),
	(113249, 229926, 'tatoeba', 'アルファベットは２６文字で成り立っています。', 'The alphabet consists of 26 letters.'),
	(113250, 175351, 'tatoeba', '犬が私の手に噛み付いた。', 'The dog bit me in the hand.'),
	(113251, 210977, 'tatoeba', 'その犬は私に噛み付こうとした。', 'The dog nipped at me.'),
	(113252, 82466, 'tatoeba', '吠える犬はめったに噛み付く事はない。', 'Barking dogs seldom bite.'),
	(113253, 192653, 'tatoeba', 'ラクダに近づくと、噛み付かれる危険があるよ。', 'If you go near a camel, you risk being bitten.'),
	(113254, 175358, 'tatoeba', '犬が噛み付かないように鎖で繋いだ方がいいですよ。', 'You had better chain up the dog so that he won\'t bite.'),
	(113255, 1698534, 'tatoeba', '犬が猫の尻尾に噛み付いた。', 'The dog bit the cat on the tail.'),
	(113256, 199458, 'tatoeba', 'どんな犬でも一度噛み付く権利がある。', 'Every dog is entitled to one bite.'),
	(113257, 10830107, 'tatoeba', '天気が崩れそうだ。', 'The weather is threatening.'),
	(113258, 88662, 'tatoeba', '彼女は床に崩れるようにして倒れた。', 'She fell in a heap to the floor.'),
	(113259, 10303736, 'tatoeba', '細かいものがないんですが、一万円って崩れますか？', 'I\'m afraid I don\'t have anything smaller. Would you be able to break a 10,000 yen note?'),
	(113260, 830845, 'tatoeba', 'ウインドウを狭めてもレイアウトが崩れない方法を教えて下さい。', 'Please tell me how I can keep the layout unchanged even with a smaller window.'),
	(113261, 8920370, 'tatoeba', 'トムは４階の自宅から、隣の川土手が崩れていくのを不安げな面持ちで見つめていた。', 'From his fourth-story apartment, Tom eyed the collapsing river bank next door with an uneasy look on his face.'),
	(113262, 83479, 'tatoeba', '壁が地震で崩れた。', 'The wall gave way in the earthquake.'),
	(113263, 10317993, 'tatoeba', '天気が崩れそうだね。', 'It seems the weather will deteriorate.'),
	(113264, 110197, 'tatoeba', '彼は圧力に屈した。', 'He yielded to pressure.'),
	(113265, 180139, 'tatoeba', '橋が圧力で落ちた。', 'The bridge crashed under the pressure.'),
	(113266, 106123, 'tatoeba', '彼は私に圧力をかけた。', 'He twisted my arm.'),
	(113267, 82474, 'tatoeba', '貿易障壁は戦争終結後解除されました。', 'Trade barriers were lifted after the war ended.'),
	(113268, 123674, 'tatoeba', '同時通訳によって言語の障壁が崩れた。', 'Simultaneous translation broke linguistic walls.'),
	(113269, 122836, 'tatoeba', '日本がそれらの障壁を撤廃しなければ米国は制裁措置を取るだろう。', 'Unless Japan eliminates those barriers, the U.S. will take sanctions.'),
	(113270, 208470, 'tatoeba', '戦争は多くの犠牲者を出して終結した。', 'The war ended with many victims.'),
	(113271, 187780, 'tatoeba', '何とか収支が合えばいいんだが。', 'I hope I can manage to make both ends meet.'),
	(113272, 156045, 'tatoeba', '私は収支を合わすのに苦労しました。', 'I had a hard time making both ends meet.'),
	(113273, 195709, 'tatoeba', 'マイケルは収支を合わせるのに苦労した。', 'Michael had a hard time making ends meet.'),
	(113274, 122549, 'tatoeba', '日本の貿易黒字は史上最高を記録しました。', 'Japan\'s trade surplus soared to a record high.'),
	(113275, 173033, 'tatoeba', '国防のため大きな額が計上された。', 'A considerable amount of money was appropriated for the national defense.'),
	(113276, 123669, 'tatoeba', '同社の税引き後利益２億ドルを計上した。', 'The company announced a profit of $200 million after tax.'),
	(113277, 636195, 'tatoeba', '経費として二千二百ドルを計上しております。', '2200 dollars have been allocated for expenses.'),
	(113278, 206403, 'tatoeba', 'その問題は当分棚上げだ。', 'That problem has been shelved for the time being.'),
