	(113427, 101240, 'tatoeba', '彼は罰せられるだろう。', 'He will be punished.'),
	(113428, 96391, 'tatoeba', '彼らは罰せられずにすんだ。', 'They escaped being punished.'),
	(113429, 183578, 'tatoeba', '危険な運転は罰せられるべきだ。', 'Dangerous driving should be punished.'),
	(113430, 124142, 'tatoeba', '盗みを働く者は罰せられて当然だ。', 'A person who steals deserves punishment.'),
	(113431, 178891, 'tatoeba', '君が彼を罰するのは筋違いだと思った。', 'We thought it wrong that you should punish him.'),
	(113432, 170231, 'tatoeba', '罪を犯したなら、罰せられなければならない。', 'If you commit a crime, you must be punished.'),
	(113433, 145754, 'tatoeba', '食料品商をやっている。', 'I am in the grocery line.'),
	(113434, 85543, 'tatoeba', '美術商はその絵を本物だと保証した。', 'The art dealer guaranteed the picture genuine.'),
