	(115693, 155188, 'tatoeba', '私は大声で彼の名前を呼んだが彼は振り向かなかった。', 'I called his name loudly, but he didn\'t even look back.'),
	(115694, 3399886, 'tatoeba', '「何お願いしたの？」「トムが振り向いてくれますようにって。メアリーは？」「内緒」', '"What did you wish for?" "That Tom would take an interest in me. What about you, Mary?" "It\'s a secret."'),
