	(118361, 11457410, 'tatoeba', '天災はいつ起こるか分からない。', 'There is no telling when disasters may strike.'),
	(118362, 96534, 'tatoeba', '彼らは長い間天災と闘わねばならなかった。', 'They had to strive against natural calamities for ages.'),
