	(118400, 176678, 'tatoeba', '軍は退却しなければならんかった。', 'The army had to retreat.'),
	(118401, 11022956, 'tatoeba', '何にだって飽きは来る。', 'One will come to find boredom in anything no matter what.'),
	(118402, 11052256, 'tatoeba', '飽きっぽい性格なもんで。', 'I\'m easily bored.'),
	(118403, 138216, 'tatoeba', '太鼓の音が聞こえる。', 'I hear the drum.'),
	(118404, 138215, 'tatoeba', '太鼓の音は遠のいていった。', 'The drum faded away.'),
	(118405, 146634, 'tatoeba', '少年がその太鼓を叩いていた。', 'A boy was beating the drum.'),
	(118406, 10741996, 'tatoeba', 'その時点ではまだ帰宅していなかった。', 'I hadn\'t returned home yet by that point.'),
	(118407, 4117284, 'tatoeba', '今の時点ではすべてを理解する必要はありません。', 'At this time, you don\'t need to understand everything.'),
	(118408, 96627, 'tatoeba', '彼らは多くの労働者たちをその時点で一時解雇した。', 'They laid off many workers at that point.'),
	(118409, 122500, 'tatoeba', '日本は一見天下泰平だが、実はいろいろな根深い問題を抱えている。', 'Japan may appear to be peaceful and tranquil on the surface but the fact is that there are a lot of deep-rooted problems.'),
	(118410, 138573, 'tatoeba', '他国への侵略は恥ずべき行為である。', 'The invasion of other countries is a shameful action.'),
	(118411, 96635, 'tatoeba', '彼らは他国の内政に干渉すべきではない。', 'They should not intervene in the internal affairs of another country.'),
	(118412, 138572, 'tatoeba', '他国を侵略することは恥ずべき行為である。', 'The invasion of other countries is a shameful action.'),
	(118413, 205514, 'tatoeba', 'それはこの国の内政問題だ。', 'That is an internal affair of this country.'),
	(118414, 210608, 'tatoeba', 'その国はわが国に内政干渉をした。', 'That country intervened in the internal affairs of our nation.'),
	(118415, 11013867, 'tatoeba', '内政干渉の明確な基準はどこですか？', 'Where\'s the line where it becomes a clear case of interference in the domestic affairs of another country?'),
	(118416, 168719, 'tatoeba', '子供たちは堤防をすべりおりた。', 'The children slid down the bank.'),
	(118417, 96638, 'tatoeba', '彼らは村を洪水から守るために堤防を補強した。', 'They strengthened the embankments to protect the village from flooding.'),
	(118418, 217541, 'tatoeba', 'コンクリートは中に鋼鉄の棒を入れる事で補強される。', 'Concrete can be reinforced by putting steel bars inside it.'),
	(118419, 10156821, 'tatoeba', '台風の日は茎が折れる危険性があるので補強する必要があります。', 'On days where there\'s a typhoon, there\'s a risk the stalks will break, so they must be reinforced.'),
	(118420, 194014, 'tatoeba', 'もう独り立ちすべき時だよ。', 'It\'s time you stood on your own two feet.'),
	(118421, 177531, 'tatoeba', '君はもう独り立ちしてもよい年齢だ。', 'You are old enough to stand on your own feet.'),
	(118422, 96640, 'tatoeba', '彼らは息子達が独り立ちできるよう育てた。', 'They had brought up their sons to stand on their own feet.'),
	(118423, 154324, 'tatoeba', '私は彼と値段が折り合った。', 'I negotiated the price with him.'),
	(118424, 103093, 'tatoeba', '彼は折り合っていきやすいひとです。', 'He is easy to get on with.'),
	(118425, 111434, 'tatoeba', '彼はなかなか折り合って行きにくい人だ。', 'He is the person who is difficult to come to terms with.'),
	(118426, 98222, 'tatoeba', '彼らはあまりうまく折り合っていないと思う。', 'I am afraid they don\'t get along very well.'),
	(118427, 111435, 'tatoeba', '彼はなかなか折り合ってつきあいにくい人だ。', 'He is rather hard to get along with.'),
	(118428, 98224, 'tatoeba', '彼らはあまりうまく折り合っていけないと思う。', 'I am afraid they can\'t get along very well.'),
	(118429, 187290, 'tatoeba', '価格の折り合えば、大量注文したいと思います。', 'If your prices are competitive, we will place a large order.'),
	(118430, 96657, 'tatoeba', '彼らは組合の指導者たちと折り合った。', 'They came to terms with the union leaders.'),
	(118431, 233837, 'tatoeba', 'あなたと私の悩みは似通っている。', 'Your problem and mine are similar.'),
	(118432, 174844, 'tatoeba', '現代の世界の文化はいくぶん似通ってきている。', 'The cultures of the world are now becoming rather similar.'),
	(118433, 96670, 'tatoeba', '彼らは全ての点でお互いに似通っている。', 'They resemble each other in all respects.'),
	(118434, 105755, 'tatoeba', '彼は私の前方を歩いた。', 'He walked ahead of me.'),
	(118435, 140930, 'tatoeba', '前方に赤い車が見える。', 'I see a red car ahead.'),
	(118436, 195362, 'tatoeba', 'まっすぐ前方を見なさい。', 'Look straight ahead.'),
	(118437, 10570153, 'tatoeba', '私が船長だ。', 'I\'m the captain.'),
