	(118439, 123288, 'tatoeba', '突然船長は船を離れた。', 'Suddenly, the captain left the ship.'),
	(118440, 174969, 'tatoeba', '厳密に言うと、君は正しくない。', 'Strictly speaking, you are not right.'),
	(118441, 174970, 'tatoeba', '厳密に言うと、トマトは果物です。', 'Strictly speaking, a tomato is a fruit.'),
	(118442, 218426, 'tatoeba', 'これは厳密にいえば間違いである。', 'This is, strictly speaking, a mistake.'),
	(118443, 11792779, 'tatoeba', '戦争は回避できない。', 'War is unavoidable.'),
	(118444, 174863, 'tatoeba', '現実を回避するのはもうやめろ。', 'Stop hiding your head in the sand.'),
	(118445, 11047003, 'tatoeba', '赤点回避のコツがわかってきた。', 'I came to realize the trick of how to avoid a failing grade.'),
	(118446, 154953, 'tatoeba', '私は適当な答えを探し求めた。', 'I cast about for a suitable reply.'),
	(118447, 103785, 'tatoeba', '彼は新しい職を探し求めている。', 'He is seeking a new position.'),
	(118448, 119302, 'tatoeba', '彼こそ我々が探し求めていた人だ。', 'He is the very man that we\'ve been looking for.'),
	(118449, 179694, 'tatoeba', '金を探し求めて大勢の人々が西にむかった。', 'Many men went west in search of gold.'),
	(118450, 212019, 'tatoeba', 'その科学者は谷で恐竜の骨を探し求めた。', 'The scientist searched for the bones of the dinosaurs in the valley.'),
	(118451, 8995373, 'tatoeba', '多分、ここは私が探し求めている場所とは違うんだ。', 'This is maybe not the place I\'m looking for.'),
	(118452, 96680, 'tatoeba', '彼らは戦争を回避しようと、あらゆる手段を探し求めた。', 'They explored every avenue in an attempt to avoid war.'),
