	(118483, 2698372, 'tatoeba', '5円玉は黄銅、10円玉は青銅でできている。', 'The 5 yen coin is made from brass and the 10 yen coin is made from bronze.'),
	(118484, 208333, 'tatoeba', 'その像はブロンズで鋳造されていた。', 'The statue was cast in bronze.'),
	(118485, 96728, 'tatoeba', '彼らは声を張り上げて叫んだ。', 'They shouted at the top of their voices.'),
	(118486, 11563159, 'tatoeba', '声を張り上げるのはやめてください。', 'Please don\'t raise your voice at me.'),
