	(122813, 123268, 'tatoeba', '鳶に油揚げをさらわれたようなものだ。', 'I was robbed of my rightful share.'),
	(122814, 123277, 'tatoeba', '突然彼女は甲高い声で叫び出した。', 'All at once she began to shout in a shrill voice.'),
