	(123669, 140806, 'tatoeba', '全市に夜間外出禁止令が布かれた。', 'A curfew was imposed on the city.'),
	(123670, 9857011, 'tatoeba', 'この証明書は令和5年末まで有効です。', 'This certificate is valid until the end of 2023.'),
	(123671, 137339, 'tatoeba', '大統領は憲法を停止し、戒厳令をしきました。', 'The President suspended the constitution and imposed martial law.'),
	(123672, 14065768, 'tatoeba', '俺のアカウントは無効のままだ。', 'My account is still disabled.'),
	(123673, 180083, 'tatoeba', '脅迫のもとになされた約束は無効だ。', 'A promise given under a threat is worthless.'),
	(123674, 137374, 'tatoeba', '大投資かは株を買い占めた。', 'The big investor bought up the stocks.'),
	(123675, 137382, 'tatoeba', '大都会の喧騒と雑踏の中に住んでいると、時折田舎に出かけて行きたくなる。', 'Living in the noise and bustle of a large city, we sometimes feel like going into the country.'),
	(123676, 235674, 'tatoeba', '１年間の間に息子は頑強になった。', 'In the course of a year my son grew stronger.'),
	(123677, 7357424, 'tatoeba', '当局は地域住民の頑強な抵抗にあった。', 'The authorities met with unyielding opposition from the locals.'),
	(123678, 137411, 'tatoeba', '大蔵省の役人は景気回復への信頼をより高めようとしました。', 'Finance Ministry officials tried to boost confidence in recovery.'),
	(123679, 137536, 'tatoeba', '大山鳴動してねずみ一匹。', 'The mountains have brought forth a mouse.'),
	(123680, 137412, 'tatoeba', '大騒ぎした割には、大山鳴動して鼠一匹ということになったようだね。', 'Everybody was so up in arms but it seems they got all panicky about nothing.'),
	(123681, 144260, 'tatoeba', '人間は大昔に道具の使用を覚えた。', 'Man learned early to use tools.'),
	(123682, 230830, 'tatoeba', 'あの城は大昔の時代に建てられた。', 'That castle was built in ancient times.'),
	(123683, 137466, 'tatoeba', '大勢の人がその旧跡を訪れる。', 'A large number of people visit the historic site.'),
	(123684, 180116, 'tatoeba', '橋は大水で洗い流された。', 'The bridge was washed away by the flood.'),
	(123685, 190837, 'tatoeba', '医者は患者に投薬した。', 'The doctor administered medicine to the patient.'),
	(123686, 137474, 'tatoeba', '大人への一回分の最大の投薬量はどのくらいですか。', 'What is the maximum dosage for an adult?'),
	(123687, 8861371, 'tatoeba', 'トムは投薬の内容を変えてほしいと、主治医に頼んだ。', 'Tom asked his doctor to change his medication.'),
	(123688, 137487, 'tatoeba', '大臣は新聞記者たちからの矢継ぎ早の質問に直面しなくてはならなかった。', 'The minister had to face a barrage of questions from the press.'),
	(123689, 10657912, 'tatoeba', 'お手伝いします。', 'We\'ll help you.'),
	(123690, 227044, 'tatoeba', 'お手伝いしますよ。', 'I am willing to help you.'),
	(123691, 227048, 'tatoeba', 'お手伝いしましょう。', 'Let me help you.'),
	(123692, 185249, 'tatoeba', '会社は時差通勤を導入しようとしています。', 'The company is attempting to stagger work hours.'),
	(123693, 211811, 'tatoeba', 'その会社は経営に日本式のやり方を導入した。', 'The company introduced Japanese methods into its business.'),
	(123694, 207385, 'tatoeba', 'その二つの村は隣接している。', 'The two villages adjoin each other.'),
	(123695, 196999, 'tatoeba', 'フランスはスペインに隣接する。', 'France is adjacent to Spain.'),
	(123696, 8631643, 'tatoeba', 'ドイツはスイスと隣接してるの？', 'Does Germany share a border with Switzerland?'),
	(123697, 137537, 'tatoeba', '大雑把に言えば、バスには３０名ほどの人達がいました。', 'Roughly speaking, there were about 30 people in the bus.'),
	(123698, 137540, 'tatoeba', '大阪支店に在勤中にはいろいろお世話になりました。', 'Thank you very much for everything while working for the Osaka branch.'),
	(123699, 1144618, 'tatoeba', 'とても騒々しかったので、私の言うことを聞き取ってもらえなかった。', 'It was so noisy that I couldn\'t make myself heard.'),
	(123700, 1142001, 'tatoeba', 'そこはとても騒がしかったので、私の言うことを聞き取ってもらえなかった。', 'It was so noisy there that I couldn\'t make myself heard.'),
	(123701, 235603, 'tatoeba', '２．大根は拍子木に切る。', '2. Cut the daikon into long sticks.'),
	(123702, 137561, 'tatoeba', '大根は人参より高いかもしれない。', 'Daikon might be more expensive than the carrots.'),
	(123703, 144199, 'tatoeba', '人参は目によい。', 'Carrots are good for the eyesight.'),
	(123704, 644611, 'tatoeba', '彼は人参が嫌いです。', 'He hates carrots.'),
	(123705, 9143409, 'tatoeba', '人参なんか大っ嫌い。', 'I hate carrots.'),
	(123706, 209276, 'tatoeba', 'その小国は隣の大国に併合された。', 'The small country was annexed to its larger neighbor.'),
	(123707, 207715, 'tatoeba', 'その帝国はすべての小国を併合した。', 'The empire absorbed all the small states.'),
	(123708, 137568, 'tatoeba', '大好物なんだ。', 'They\'re my favorite.'),
	(123709, 11041827, 'tatoeba', 'これ、大好物なの。', 'This is my favorite food.'),
	(123710, 11935608, 'tatoeba', 'ピザが大好物です。', 'Pizza is my favourite food.'),
	(123711, 137570, 'tatoeba', '大口叩きは何もできない。', 'Great talkers are little doers.'),
	(123712, 11491022, 'tatoeba', '煙突掃除が必要ね。', 'The chimney needs to be cleaned.'),
	(123713, 188731, 'tatoeba', '煙突は煙を出し始めた。', 'The chimney began to give out smoke.'),
	(123714, 188734, 'tatoeba', '煙突から煙が出ている。', 'Smoke is rising from the chimney.'),
	(123715, 10996778, 'tatoeba', 'このプレハブ小屋が本部なの？', 'This prefab cabin is HQ?'),
	(123716, 542174, 'tatoeba', '県警察本部長は警察官の綱紀を正そうとした。', 'The prefectural police chief tried to tighten his police officers\' discipline.'),
	(123717, 137600, 'tatoeba', '大学本部はニューヨークに分校を設立することを決定した。', 'The University Administration decided to set up a branch campus in New York.'),
	(123718, 8619736, 'tatoeba', 'トムは卒業生です。', 'Tom is a graduate.'),
	(123719, 12462006, 'tatoeba', 'この学校の卒業生です。', 'I am a graduate of this school.'),
	(123720, 176797, 'tatoeba', '君も私も大学の卒業生だ。', 'Both you and I are college graduates.'),
	(123721, 137613, 'tatoeba', '大学時代に私は英字新聞をとっていた。', 'I took an English newspaper when I was in college.'),
	(123722, 232269, 'tatoeba', 'あなたは英字新聞を定期購読したことがありますか。', 'Have you ever subscribed to any English language newspaper?'),
	(123723, 173556, 'tatoeba', '構内で昨日彼女に会ったよ。', 'I met her on campus yesterday.'),
	(123724, 11592438, 'tatoeba', '大学構内を案内してくださったのよ。', 'She showed me around the campus.'),
	(123725, 12113093, 'tatoeba', '大学構内での飲酒は禁止されています。', 'Drinking is forbidden on campus.'),
	(123726, 1821519, 'tatoeba', '大海の一滴。', 'A drop in the bucket.'),
	(123727, 137652, 'tatoeba', '大海にはたくさん魚がいる。', 'Fish abounds in the ocean.'),
	(123728, 190729, 'tatoeba', '井の中の蛙、大海を知らず。', 'He who stays in the valley shall never get over the hill.'),
	(123729, 165768, 'tatoeba', '私たちは阪神の大ファンです。', 'We are great Tigers fans.'),
	(123730, 170188, 'tatoeba', '阪神大震災では地面が長時間に渡って揺れた。', 'In the Hanshin earthquake, the ground shook for a long time.'),
	(123731, 11603938, 'tatoeba', '大雨でダムが決壊した。', 'The dam burst owing to the heavy rain.'),
	(123732, 137673, 'tatoeba', '大雨のためにダムが決壊した。', 'The dam burst owing to the heavy rain.'),
	(123733, 11603933, 'tatoeba', 'ダムは決壊し、谷は水に飲まれた。', 'The dam burst and water flooded the valley.'),
	(123734, 11211888, 'tatoeba', '盆栽は風情がある。', 'Bonsai trees are elegant.'),
	(123735, 137681, 'tatoeba', '大雨で盆栽がめちゃくちゃになった。', 'The heavy rain made a mess of the bonsai.'),
	(123736, 9694092, 'tatoeba', '私のね、桜の盆栽が咲き始めたんだ。', 'My bonsai, which is the cherry tree, is starting to bloom.'),
	(123737, 137688, 'tatoeba', '大まかに言って、犬は猫より忠実だ。', 'Broadly speaking, dogs are more faithful than cats.'),
	(123738, 1157159, 'tatoeba', 'どんな話だったか、大まかに説明してみてよ。', 'Try to explain roughly what the talk was about.'),
	(123739, 176079, 'tatoeba', '警察官はその少女に、いなくなった犬の大まかな絵を描くように求めた。', 'The police asked the girl to make a rough sketch of her lost dog.'),
	(123740, 221317, 'tatoeba', 'この手紙を書き終えたら、あの山の２マイルほど先の湖水にご案内しましょう。', 'When I have finished writing the letter, I will take you to the lake about two miles beyond the hill.'),
	(123741, 11095675, 'tatoeba', 'トラックが乗用車にぶつかりました。', 'The truck hit a car.'),
	(123742, 137721, 'tatoeba', '大きな乗用車が止まり、背の高い女性が降りた。', 'A big car drew up and a tall lady got out.'),
	(123743, 137742, 'tatoeba', '大きな渦巻きと急流があります。', 'It has a big whirlpool and a strong current.'),
	(123744, 196551, 'tatoeba', 'ボートは急流に巻き込まれた。', 'The boat was sucked in.'),
	(123745, 222381, 'tatoeba', 'この急流で泳ぐのは危険に違いない。', 'It must be dangerous to swim in this rapid stream.'),
	(123746, 137764, 'tatoeba', 'その作品が画壇に大いに物議をかもした。', 'This artwork excited much controversy in the world of art.'),
	(123747, 137772, 'tatoeba', '台本に目を通しておいてください。', 'Please go over the script.'),
	(123748, 9675876, 'tatoeba', '君、どっち方面に住んでるの？', 'In which district do you live?'),
	(123749, 176618, 'tatoeba', '兄はあなたと同じ方面の仕事をしています。', 'My brother is in the same line of business as you are.'),
	(123750, 137774, 'tatoeba', '台風は発達しながら九州方面に向かっています。', 'The typhoon is gaining strength as it heads for Kyushu.'),
	(123751, 3054154, 'tatoeba', '先週、関東で大雪が降りました。', 'A lot of snow fell on the Kanto region last week.'),
	(123752, 137784, 'tatoeba', '台風は午後２時頃関東地方に接近するでしょう。', 'The typhoon will approach the Kanto district around two in the afternoon.'),
	(123753, 137788, 'tatoeba', '台風の余波で２日間停電した。', 'There was no electricity for two days in the aftermath of the typhoon.'),
	(123754, 12037990, 'tatoeba', '台風で休校になりました。', 'Because of the typhoon, the school was closed.'),
	(123755, 137798, 'tatoeba', '台風のために休校になった。', 'The typhoon accounted for the closing of school.'),
	(123756, 182632, 'tatoeba', '休校は大雪のためであった。', 'The closing of school was due to the heavy snow.'),
	(123757, 11563620, 'tatoeba', '台風は東京を直撃した。', 'The typhoon hit Tokyo.'),
	(123758, 2700227, 'tatoeba', 'トムの乗っていた電車に雷が直撃した。', 'The train that Tom was riding was hit by lightning.'),
	(123759, 137818, 'tatoeba', '台風１２号は九州地方を直撃するだろうか。', 'Will Typhoon No. 12 hit the Kyushu district?'),
	(123760, 137819, 'tatoeba', '台風１１号は、毎時２０キロメートルの速さで北上中です。', 'Typhoon No.11 is moving up north at twenty kilometers per hour.'),
	(123761, 151803, 'tatoeba', '私達はそこで不快な経験をした。', 'We had an unpleasant experience there.'),
	(123762, 137823, 'tatoeba', '台所はひどく不快な臭いがします。', 'There\'s a foul smell in the kitchen.'),
	(123763, 12957167, 'tatoeba', '不快な思いさせてたら、ごめんね。', 'I\'m sorry if I made you uncomfortable.'),
	(123764, 182122, 'tatoeba', '魚が真っ黒に焦げた。', 'The fish is burnt black.'),
	(123765, 188119, 'tatoeba', '何かが焦げてる匂いがする。', 'I smell something burning.'),
	(123766, 205073, 'tatoeba', 'それは焦げている臭いとは全然違う。', 'It\'s quite distinct from the smell of burning.'),
	(123767, 148875, 'tatoeba', '灼熱の太陽で体が焦げるほどだった。', 'The scorching sun grilled us.'),
	(123768, 227386, 'tatoeba', 'お菓子が焦げないように気をつけていなさい。', 'You must see to it that the cakes do not burn.'),
	(123769, 234730, 'tatoeba', 'あーあ、トーストが真っ黒に焦げてしまっているよ。', 'Oh, the toast is burned black.'),
	(123770, 9162422, 'tatoeba', '朝食は、卵２個と焦げたトースト１枚だった。', 'For breakfast, I had two eggs and a burnt piece of toast.'),
	(123771, 226647, 'tatoeba', 'お母さん、何か焦げている臭いがするわ。', 'I smell something burning, Mother.'),
	(123772, 8932315, 'tatoeba', 'トムはアリを駆除しようとした。', 'Tom tried to get rid of the ants.'),
	(123773, 137839, 'tatoeba', '台所からゴキブリを駆除しなければならない。', 'I must rid my kitchen of cockroaches.'),
	(123774, 186314, 'tatoeba', '我々の家からゴキブリを駆除するのはとても難しい。', 'It is very hard to get rid of cockroaches from our house.'),
	(123775, 137840, 'tatoeba', '代理人ではなくあなた本人が来てください。', 'You are supposed to come in person.'),
	(123776, 214966, 'tatoeba', 'すぐにあなたの代理人に連絡を取りなさい。', 'Get in touch with your agent right away.'),
	(123777, 167561, 'tatoeba', '私が町を離れている間、弟を私の代理人にした。', 'I made my brother my agent while I was out of the city.'),
	(123778, 149627, 'tatoeba', '執行部の交替で彼は失職した。', 'Owing to a change of administrations, he lost his job.'),
	(123779, 173921, 'tatoeba', '口は体の死刑執行人であり医者である。', 'The mouth is the executioner and the doctor of the body.'),
	(123780, 137849, 'tatoeba', '代議民主制は１つの政治形態である。', 'Representative democracy is one form of government.'),
	(123781, 137859, 'tatoeba', '隊長は部下に撃てと命令した。', 'The captain ordered his men to fire.'),
	(123782, 137853, 'tatoeba', '隊長以下の者がこの建物に住む。', 'Men of the rank of captain and below live in this building.'),
	(123783, 137854, 'tatoeba', '隊長は礼砲を放つように命じた。', 'The captain gave orders for a salute to be fired.'),
	(123784, 137860, 'tatoeba', '隊長は長時間行進させて新兵たちを訓練した。', 'The captain exercised the new recruits with long marches.');
INSERT INTO `sentences` (`id`, `tatoeba_id`, `source`, `ja`, `en`) VALUES
	(123785, 137884, 'tatoeba', '貸し切りバスを一台都合して欲しいんですが。', 'I want to charter a bus.'),
	(123786, 3460778, 'tatoeba', 'ここは貸し部屋です。', 'This room is for rent.'),
	(123787, 137887, 'tatoeba', '貸し家を持っています。', 'We have a house for rent.'),
	(123788, 137924, 'tatoeba', '待てば海路の日和あり。', 'Everything comes to those who wait.'),
	(123789, 11883221, 'tatoeba', '散歩日和だった。', 'It was a perfect day for a walk.'),
	(123790, 9171330, 'tatoeba', 'めっちゃいい天気だよ。今日は絶好の洗濯日和だね。', 'The weather today\'s super nice, perfect for doing laundry!'),
	(123791, 137938, 'tatoeba', '待っていたのは黒光りのする大型車だった。', 'The waiting car was big and black and shiny.'),
	(123792, 137955, 'tatoeba', '対岸の火事で良かった。', 'I am glad it was someone else who got it.'),
	(123793, 866830, 'tatoeba', 'ひとりの男が対岸で釣りをしていた。', 'A man was fishing on the opposite bank.'),
	(123794, 171999, 'tatoeba', '今日では対外関係と国内問題には親密な関係がある。', 'Nowadays there is a close relationship between foreign relations and domestic affairs.'),
	(123795, 137961, 'tatoeba', '体面を保つために行った。', 'For appearances sake, I went.'),
	(123796, 229550, 'tatoeba', 'あんな行動は彼の体面を汚すものだ。', 'Such behavior is beneath his dignity.'),
	(123797, 148099, 'tatoeba', '醜聞のニュースのため、その政治家は体面を失った。', 'News of the scandal caused the politician to lose face.'),
	(123798, 137969, 'tatoeba', '体積を計算するなら、縦と横と深さを掛ければよい。', 'To calculate the volume, multiply the length by the width by the depth.'),
	(123799, 137970, 'tatoeba', '体積が大きいからといって常に重量も重いとは限らない。', 'Great bulk does not always mean great weight.'),
	(123800, 198614, 'tatoeba', 'ねじ、てこ、くさび、滑車などは単一機械と呼ばれる。', 'The screw, the lever, the wedge, the pulley, etc. are called simple machines.'),
	(123801, 137971, 'tatoeba', '体制に従おうとする意識は、この単一民族社会の本質的な要素である。', 'Conformity is an essential element of our homogeneous community.'),
	(123802, 183847, 'tatoeba', '看護婦は体温計で彼の体温を計った。', 'The nurse took his temperature with a thermometer.'),
	(123803, 137985, 'tatoeba', '体温計を口にくわえて、体温を測りましたか。', 'Did you take your temperature with a thermometer in your mouth?'),
	(123804, 4001518, 'tatoeba', '「お母さん、体温計知らない？」「いつもの場所にないの？」「うん、ないみたい」', '"Mom, do you know where the thermometer is?" "It\'s not in the usual place?" "Yeah, I checked."'),
	(123805, 137997, 'tatoeba', '体育の授業は全員が必修です。', 'The physical fitness courses are required for everyone.'),
	(123806, 138024, 'tatoeba', '打球がインかアウトかを判定するのは難しいことが多い。', 'It is often difficult to see if a ball is in or out.'),
	(123807, 138025, 'tatoeba', '打開策を見つけるのが先決だ。', 'In the first place we must find a way out of this.'),
	(123808, 174852, 'tatoeba', '現状の打開策を暗中模索している。', 'We are groping for a way out of the present situation.'),
	(123809, 177435, 'tatoeba', '君は煙草を吸うのをやめるのが先決だ。', 'First, you have to stop smoking.'),
	(123810, 138026, 'tatoeba', '打つ手がないね。', 'I\'m all out of tricks.'),
	(123811, 9203469, 'tatoeba', 'もう打つ手がないんだよ。', 'There\'s nothing to be done about it.'),
	(123812, 138131, 'tatoeba', '太陽の照り返しが強い。', 'There\'s a lot of glare.'),
	(123813, 138177, 'tatoeba', '太陽が家並みの上に出る。', 'The sun rises above the houses.'),
	(123814, 138224, 'tatoeba', '太っているのが私の切実な問題です。', 'Being fat is a serious problem for me.'),
	(123815, 3324267, 'tatoeba', '大したことではないと思われるかもしれませんが、私にとっては切実な悩みなんです。', 'It may not seem like a big deal, but, to me, it\'s a serious problem.'),
	(123816, 138234, 'tatoeba', '多弁な人は実行はともわない。', 'The greatest talkers are the least doers.'),
	(123817, 211611, 'tatoeba', 'その干ばつの間に多勢の農民が死んだ。', 'Many peasants died during the drought.'),
	(123818, 211903, 'tatoeba', 'その会は外務省の後援で開かれた。', 'That party was held under the auspices of the Foreign Ministry.'),
	(123819, 138267, 'tatoeba', '多数の有名人がその動きを後援している。', 'Many famous people are behind the movement.'),
	(123820, 210831, 'tatoeba', 'その後援者は本物の骨董品の良さが分かる。', 'The patron appreciates genuine antiques.'),
	(123821, 138287, 'tatoeba', '多角的に見なければならない。', 'We must examine the various aspects.'),
	(123822, 163644, 'tatoeba', '私の考えでは、資産の多角的に投資する必要がある。', 'In my opinion, we need to diversify our assets.'),
	(123823, 211804, 'tatoeba', 'その会社は市場を拡大するために最近の製品の多角化を図った。', 'The firm has recently diversified its products so as to extend its market.'),
	(123824, 173546, 'tatoeba', '洪水で何百という畑が冠水した。', 'Hundreds of fields were submerged in the flood.'),
	(123825, 10291226, 'tatoeba', '雨が降ると道が冠水しちゃうんだ。', 'Our streets flood when we have rain.'),
	(123826, 138309, 'tatoeba', '多くの道路が冠水し、その結果大幅な遅れが出ている。', 'Many roads are flooded. As a result there are long delays.'),
	(123827, 158229, 'tatoeba', '私は往来で財布を拾った。', 'I picked up a purse in the street.'),
	(123828, 224299, 'tatoeba', 'ここは車の往来が激しい。', 'The traffic is heavy here.'),
	(123829, 148726, 'tatoeba', '若人も老人も、ほっそりとした姿を望む。', 'Both young and old people desire slim figures.'),
	(123830, 13810757, 'tatoeba', '彼は親しみやすい若人である。私は彼が好きだ。', 'He is a personable young man. I like him.'),
