	(128749, 402573, 'tatoeba', '結婚直前、泥酔の父親は「何処の馬の骨か解らん奴に娘をやれん！」と花婿に怒鳴りつけた。', 'Just before the wedding, the drunken father shouted at the groom: "I won\'t hand out my daughter to some stranger!"'),
