	(128838, 504501, 'tatoeba', 'この世界は、あなたたちの住む世界から遥か３億光年離れた位置にあります。', 'This world is a distant three hundred million light years away from the world where you live.'),
	(128839, 1721893, 'tatoeba', '学校の終業式が昨日あった。', 'Yesterday was the school closing ceremony.'),
	(128840, 1110574, 'tatoeba', '終業時間までまだ一時間もあるのに、同僚の順子はいそいそと帰り支度を始めた。', 'Even though we still had an hour until closing time, my colleague Junko excitedly started getting ready to go home.'),
	(128841, 509634, 'tatoeba', '兄が民謡に興味を抱き始めたのは十二歳ごろだった。', 'My older brother started to take interest in Japanese folk songs when he was around 12 years old.'),
	(128842, 4766462, 'tatoeba', '逃げ道がない。', 'There\'s nowhere to run.'),
	(128843, 515524, 'tatoeba', '彼女に逃げ道はない。', 'There\'s no escape for her.'),
	(128844, 4257803, 'tatoeba', '冷え性を治すいい方法があれば教えてください。', 'If there is a way to treat my sensitivity to cold, then please tell me.'),
	(128845, 518611, 'tatoeba', '彼がめちゃ暑がりで私は冷え性です。寝室はどうしましょう。', 'He\'s really sensitive to heat and I\'m sensitive to the cold. What should we do about our bedroom?'),
	(128846, 519860, 'tatoeba', 'もう、極限だ。', 'I can\'t take any more!'),
	(128847, 10318018, 'tatoeba', 'それが私のお家よ。', 'That\'s my house.'),
	(128848, 520393, 'tatoeba', 'お家に帰りたいです。', 'I want to go home.'),
	(128849, 521125, 'tatoeba', '今朝、山羽さんが卸で胡桃を３０キロ買いました。', 'This morning, Mr Yamaha bought 30 kilos of walnuts wholesale.'),
	(128850, 521138, 'tatoeba', '山羽さんが乞食に胡桃を呉れてやりました。', 'Mr Yamaha gave some walnuts to a beggar.'),
	(128851, 11003514, 'tatoeba', '防犯カメラの映像をよく見たら人がいた。', 'If you look at the security camera footage closely, there\'s a person there.'),
	(128852, 8499668, 'tatoeba', '防犯のために登下校時は、名札を外してください。', 'In order to prevent crime, please take off your name tag when travelling to and from school.'),
	(128853, 521680, 'tatoeba', 'まずは防犯意識をしっかり持ちましょう！ 出かける前には戸締りを！', 'First hold crime-prevention firmly in mind! Before going out, lock the doors!'),
	(128854, 8997638, 'tatoeba', 'その水、生ぬるいよ。', 'The water is lukewarm.'),
	(128855, 8997639, 'tatoeba', '水は、生ぬるかった。', 'The water was lukewarm.'),
	(128856, 522264, 'tatoeba', 'コストダウンもできない生ぬるいリストラがJAL再建を危うくする。', 'Half-hearted cutbacks that can\'t save money leave JAL\'s rehabilitation in doubt.'),
	(128857, 523566, 'tatoeba', '私は彼女の名前を度忘れした。', 'For a moment I forgot what her name was.'),
	(128858, 531350, 'tatoeba', '昭和１０年は西暦１９３５年です。', 'The 10th year of Showa is 1935 in the Western calendar.'),
	(128859, 538098, 'tatoeba', '胃酸過多で空腹になると胃痛に苦しむ方に良いのがトマトです。', 'Tomatoes are good for people who suffer stomach pain from excess stomach acid when their stomach is empty.'),
	(128860, 538116, 'tatoeba', '水道水には塩素、鉛などの有害物質が含まれている可能性がある。', 'There\'s a chance that tap water may contain harmful substances like chlorine and lead.'),
	(128861, 8215943, 'tatoeba', 'トムは神童だった。', 'Tom was a prodigy.'),
	(128862, 543070, 'tatoeba', '彼は本当に神童である。', 'He truly is a prodigy.'),
	(128863, 543744, 'tatoeba', '外国人の片寄った日本観が好きだ。忍者、変態アニメ、武士道などが出てくると本当幸せになる。', 'I like the one-sided view foreigners have of Japan. It makes me happy when ninjas, hentai anime, samurai and stuff like that come up.'),
	(128864, 1207285, 'tatoeba', 'そういうのって、愛情表現じゃなくて「変態」って言うんじゃないの？', 'Isn\'t that more like something a pervert would say? Not someone expressing their love.'),
	(128865, 3347368, 'tatoeba', '「トムどうしたの？」「メアリーに何カップ？って聞いたら変態って言われた」「当たり前だろ」', '"What happened, Tom?" "When I asked Mary what cup size she is, she called me a pervert." "What did you expect?"'),
	(128866, 11427642, 'tatoeba', '苗字は何て言うの？', 'What\'s your last name?'),
	(128867, 545837, 'tatoeba', '私の苗字はワンです。', 'My surname is Wan.'),
	(128868, 1487293, 'tatoeba', '私の苗字は周と言います。', 'My surname is Zhou.'),
	(128869, 546082, 'tatoeba', '試合の日の朝になって雨が止んだのは、みんなの心がけがいいからだ。', 'Because of everyone\'s correct-mindedness, the rain stopped on the morning of the match day.'),
	(128870, 549270, 'tatoeba', '天国にいらつしやる基督様。どうか私を御守り下さいまし。', 'Lord Jesus Christ in heaven, please protect me.'),
	(128871, 557855, 'tatoeba', 'なぜ、Ａ社の傘下に入ることを選んだのか。', 'Why did you decide to affiliate yourself with Company A?'),
	(128872, 10807022, 'tatoeba', 'チャーハンが喰いてー。', 'I want to eat fried rice.'),
	(128873, 10555622, 'tatoeba', '喰え。ボーッとしてないで。', 'Eat. Don\'t get distracted.'),
	(128874, 8646343, 'tatoeba', 'これで、真面目な人も喰いついてくれるかな。', 'I wonder if people who are serious about it will also dig their teeth into this?'),
	(128875, 1136175, 'tatoeba', '森に行ったら、人喰い鬼に気をつけてください！', 'If you go into the forest, watch out for the man-eating ogres!'),
	(128876, 564276, 'tatoeba', 'この土地の人は、この川を、人喰い川と呼んで、恐怖している。', 'The locals call this river the man-eating river and fear it.'),
	(128877, 564642, 'tatoeba', '孔雀だよ。いま鳴いたのは孔雀だよ。', 'It\'s a peacock. It was a peacock that cried just now.'),
	(128878, 569242, 'tatoeba', '天皇陛下万歳！', 'Long live the Emperor!'),
	(128879, 570098, 'tatoeba', 'レオナルド・ダ・ヴィンチの美術素描は約９００点現存しています。', 'There remain approximately 900 art sketches by Leonardo da Vinci.'),
	(128880, 11257897, 'tatoeba', '一円も使わなかった。', 'I didn\'t spend a penny.'),
	(128881, 574015, 'tatoeba', '一円盗んで見に行く決心をしたが、貧乏の家に盗める一円なんぞ有ろう筈がない。', 'I had resolved to steal one yen to go see it, but we were poor and there was no way I would find one yen to steal around our house.'),
	(128882, 589483, 'tatoeba', 'この長火鉢は、震災でなくなってしまった。', 'I lost this oblong Japanese brazier in an earthquake.'),
	(128883, 1125379, 'tatoeba', '震災後このエリアの地価は大きく下がった。', 'After the earthquake, the land value in this area went down a lot.'),
	(128884, 10543782, 'tatoeba', 'うちのキャンパスでは、少なくとも年に一度は震災訓練があるよ。', 'On our campus, we have earthquake drills at least once a year.'),
	(128885, 589485, 'tatoeba', 'ある日、私が戻ってくると、女房と、友人の某とが、炬燵の中に入っているのである。', 'One day, I came back and my wife and one of my friends were inside the kotatsu.'),
	(128886, 589574, 'tatoeba', '手紙に貼る三銭切手が買えないで、幾日も床の間の上に置いてあるようになった。', 'I could not buy the 3 sen stamp to put on the letter, so it ended up staying for many days on top of the tokonoma.'),
	(128887, 2277326, 'tatoeba', 'この辺の意地悪婆さんが雷に打たれて頓死したらしい。まさに天罰覿面だとうちの母さんが言う。', 'It seems the mean old woman that lived around here was struck by lightning and suddenly died. My mother says it\'s truly a case of the swiftness of Heaven\'s vengeance.'),
	(128888, 589601, 'tatoeba', '時々大家の婆さんが見にきて 「泣かない子ね」 と云ったが、私の子守は天才的に上手であった。', 'Sometimes the old landlady would come by and said "That child doesn\'t cry", but it was that my babysitting was godly.'),
	(128889, 594047, 'tatoeba', '彼は悪童である。', 'He is a naughty boy.'),
	(128890, 596275, 'tatoeba', '扉の傍に、精巧な、軽金属製のロボット——侵入者を防ぐためのロボットが、冷かに立っていた。', 'Near the door, an elaborate metal robot -- a robot designed to keep away intruders, was standing coldly.'),
	(128891, 604646, 'tatoeba', 'マフィンを受ける数は、IRCでしゃべる回数に反比例して変化する。', 'The number of muffins that you\'ll receive will be inversely proportional to the number of times you talk on IRC.'),
	(128892, 621827, 'tatoeba', '両軍は対峙して、むなしく日を送るばかりでした。', 'Both armies were placed one in front of the other and spent their days doing nothing.'),
	(128893, 627762, 'tatoeba', 'スミスさんが「海兵隊は必要ない」と言いました。', 'Mr Smith said, "There\'s no need for the Marines."'),
	(128894, 629001, 'tatoeba', '多くの人がこの自由の旗印の下に集った。', 'Many people gathered under this banner of freedom.'),
	(128895, 629077, 'tatoeba', 'その本を書いた人は、機知とユーモアを兼ね備えた人だね。', 'The person who wrote that book is possessed of both humour and wit, isn\'t he?'),
	(128896, 630566, 'tatoeba', '男性は女性よりも筋力がある。', 'Men are physically stronger than women.'),
	(128897, 7005388, 'tatoeba', '掃除って下手な筋トレよりよっぽど筋力つくよね。', 'Sweeping is better than poorly-done weight training for strengthening your muscles.'),
	(128898, 630621, 'tatoeba', 'あなたは妊婦さんですか？', 'Are you pregnant?'),
	(128899, 881770, 'tatoeba', '妊婦はたいてい、悪阻を経験する。', 'Pregnant women often experience morning sickness.'),
	(128900, 881742, 'tatoeba', '妊婦妻がいるのに結婚指輪外して合コンに参加してもいいですか？', 'Is it OK for me to remove my wedding ring and go to a dating party when I have a pregnant wife?'),
	(128901, 9554181, 'tatoeba', '面倒臭いよ。', 'I can\'t be bothered.'),
	(128902, 631532, 'tatoeba', '生きるって本当に面倒臭ぇよなぁ～。', 'I am really tired of living.'),
	(128903, 632067, 'tatoeba', 'ロベルさんはいつも人をいろいろな依頼で攻め立てた。', 'Robert was always besieging people with requests.'),
	(128904, 635423, 'tatoeba', '乗りかかった船ということでやっていく所存です。', 'I\'ve come this far, so I\'ll keep going.'),
	(128905, 635428, 'tatoeba', '幼時から父は、私によく、金閣のことを語った。', 'When I was young, my father often talked to me about the Golden Pavilion.'),
	(128906, 635434, 'tatoeba', 'ここに先物取引で儲けた方いらっしゃいますか？', 'Has anybody here made a profit in futures trading?'),
	(128907, 636300, 'tatoeba', '社会の悪弊を糾すべきだ。', 'We must investigate social abuses.'),
	(128908, 643021, 'tatoeba', 'スポーツ界はこの際、犯罪組織との癒着を一掃すべきです。', 'The sports world should, at this time, eliminate the collusion with criminal organizations.'),
	(128909, 636328, 'tatoeba', '悪政に苦しむ国民を無視するわけにはいけません。', 'We must not ignore populations suffering under misgovernment.'),
	(128910, 636402, 'tatoeba', 'エリザベス女王の即位５０年の記念に贈られたものみたいです。', 'It seems it was a gift for the 50th anniversary of Queen Elizabeth\'s accession to the throne.'),
	(128911, 9086483, 'tatoeba', '僕たち暇つぶしにトランプをしたんだ。', 'We played cards to kill time.'),
	(128912, 636431, 'tatoeba', 'そこで暇つぶしのちょっとしたアイディアが浮んだ。', 'Then a little time-wasting idea came to mind.'),
	(128913, 637886, 'tatoeba', 'ヨーロッパでの奴隷制度の廃止は、やがてアメリカにも波及しました。', 'The abolition of slavery in Europe eventually reached America.'),
	(128914, 10138281, 'tatoeba', '虫の居所が悪いの？', 'Did you wake up on the wrong side of the bed?'),
	(128915, 10138286, 'tatoeba', '虫の居所でも悪いの？', 'Did you wake up on the wrong side of the bed?'),
	(128916, 9241033, 'tatoeba', '彼の居所を教えてあげるよ。', 'I\'ll tell you where to find him.'),
	(128917, 638334, 'tatoeba', '小林勇は幸田 露伴の愛顧を受けた。', 'Isamu Kobayashi received the patronage of Rohan Koda.'),
	(128918, 638526, 'tatoeba', '全日はそのことを考えてきた。', 'I\'ve been thinking about it the entire day.'),
	(128919, 649704, 'tatoeba', '中松は自分の頓馬な質問に苦笑いしました。', 'Nakamatsu smiled bitterly at his own stupid question.'),
	(128920, 12771429, 'tatoeba', 'トムは苦笑いをした。', 'Tom smiled bitterly.'),
	(128921, 1795640, 'tatoeba', 'その猫は可愛らしい。', 'The cat is adorable.'),
	(128922, 8907378, 'tatoeba', '本当に可愛らしい人ね。', 'You\'re so very adorable.'),
	(128923, 9442974, 'tatoeba', '可愛らしい名前だこと。', 'That\'s a pretty name.'),
	(128924, 679805, 'tatoeba', '私は退職後のために９８００坪の農場を買った。', 'I bought an eight-acre farm for my retirement.'),
	(128925, 11256139, 'tatoeba', 'あの時は大晦日前だった。', 'That time was before New Year\'s Eve.'),
	(128926, 9812386, 'tatoeba', '大晦日は友達と過ごしました。', 'I spent New Year\'s Eve with some of my friends.'),
	(128927, 5692711, 'tatoeba', '大晦日には何か特別なことをするの？', 'Are you doing anything special for New Year\'s Eve?'),
	(128928, 684617, 'tatoeba', '日本では大晦日に蕎麦を食べる習慣があります。', 'There is a custom of eating buckwheat noodles on New Year\'s Eve in Japan.'),
	(128929, 685948, 'tatoeba', '髪を梳かしましょうか？', 'Do you want me to comb your hair?'),
	(128930, 742393, 'tatoeba', 'かつての鑑定人の選任は非常に不明朗でした。', 'The old selection process for judges was very unfair.'),
	(128931, 743309, 'tatoeba', '彼はその後、累進して社長にまで進んだ。', 'Thereafter, he was gradually promoted until he became company president.'),
	(128932, 8504206, 'tatoeba', 'その運動は腹筋に良い。', 'That exercise is good for the abdominal muscles.'),
	(128933, 894819, 'tatoeba', '毎日腹筋三百回だって？そんなの絶対無理！', '300 sit-ups every day? That\'s completely impossible!'),
	(128934, 763462, 'tatoeba', 'この惣菜買いは、それから後中学へ行っても続いていた。', 'I continued buying prepared dishes even after I went to middle school.'),
	(128935, 765136, 'tatoeba', 'この文はTatoebaにより無作為に表示されています。', 'This is a sentence that is being randomly displayed through Tatoeba.'),
	(128936, 8532773, 'tatoeba', '生憎、それは本当です。', 'Unfortunately, that\'s true.'),
	(128937, 1022219, 'tatoeba', '生憎、毎朝早く起きなければなりません。', 'Unfortunately, I have to get up early every morning.'),
	(128938, 772976, 'tatoeba', '体調が悪くなっているので、生憎そんなに重い箱を運ぶことはできない。', 'I\'m not in any condition to carry such heavy boxes, unfortunately.'),
	(128939, 8801697, 'tatoeba', 'トムは昏睡状態なんですか？', 'Is Tom in a coma?'),
	(128940, 1804155, 'tatoeba', '患者は深い昏睡状態にあります。', 'The patient is in a state of profound stupor.'),
	(128941, 1787072, 'tatoeba', 'それからあなたは二ヶ月昏睡状態でした。', 'After that, you were in a state of stupor for two months.'),
	(128942, 773718, 'tatoeba', '看護婦は患部に薬を塗りました。', 'The nurse applied a medicine to the affected part.'),
	(128943, 8603532, 'tatoeba', 'トムは電話を取る前にいつも発信元の番号を確認する。', 'Tom always checks the caller ID before he answers the phone.'),
	(128944, 839014, 'tatoeba', '発信音が聞こえた後であなたのメッセージを残してください。', 'Leave your message after hearing the beep.'),
	(128945, 8603493, 'tatoeba', 'トムは電話に出る前にいつも発信元の電話番号を確認している。', 'Tom always checks the caller ID before he answers the phone.'),
	(128946, 10999433, 'tatoeba', '山形県の県庁所在地は山形市です。', 'Yamagata Prefecture\'s capital is Yamagata City.'),
	(128947, 774511, 'tatoeba', '芳田氏は山形県に生まれ、日本大学芸術学部油絵科を卒業する。', 'Mr Yoshida was born in Yamagata prefecture, and graduated from Nihon University College of Art with a degree in oil painting.'),
	(128948, 774514, 'tatoeba', '青河氏は講談社児童文学新人賞佳作を受賞する。', 'Aoga receives an honourable mention at the Kodansha Award for New Writers of Children’s Literature.'),
	(128949, 774837, 'tatoeba', '人口が益々増える一方です。', 'The population just keeps growing and growing.'),
	(128950, 12833034, 'tatoeba', '北海道のいくつかの小さな町は益々荒れています。', 'More and more of Hokkaido\'s small towns are falling into ruin.'),
	(128951, 776033, 'tatoeba', '若い女性は心が希望に満ち溢れて病魔と闘ってきた。', 'The young woman was fighting the deadly illness, her heart full of hope.'),
	(128952, 778574, 'tatoeba', 'これは中国の扇です。', 'This is a Chinese fan.'),
	(128953, 785131, 'tatoeba', '彼は伏兵に会って惨死しました。', 'He met with a tragic death in an ambush.'),
	(128954, 11263461, 'tatoeba', '魚は不味い。', 'The fish doesn\'t taste good.'),
	(128955, 10129683, 'tatoeba', '不味かったら、出してね。', 'If it tastes bad, spit it out.'),
	(128956, 787209, 'tatoeba', 'そのバーガーが不味かったんです！', 'That burger was terrible!'),
	(128957, 11014007, 'tatoeba', 'アイスは美味しくも不味くもなく、ただ甘かった。', 'The ice cream was neither good nor bad. It was just sweet.'),
	(128958, 1555119, 'tatoeba', 'この果物は不味い。', 'This fruit has a bad taste.'),
	(128959, 10796403, 'tatoeba', 'この薬、不味いのよ。', 'This medicine tastes terrible.'),
	(128960, 788165, 'tatoeba', '日本では銃撃戦はほとんどありません。', 'There are almost no gunfights in Japan.'),
	(128961, 788912, 'tatoeba', '今も、ときどき余震が発生しています。', 'Even now there are occasional aftershocks.'),
	(128962, 789600, 'tatoeba', '原子力発電所の１号機で、原子炉内の燃料の溶融が進んでいる可能性が高い、と発表された。', 'It was announced that there is a high possibility of the fuel within the nuclear reactor of Nuclear Plant 1 melting.'),
	(128963, 792559, 'tatoeba', 'じゃが芋と人参とネギを入れました。', 'I included onions, carrots, and potatoes.'),
	(128964, 10107038, 'tatoeba', '玉ねぎはじゃが芋よりも火が通りやすい。', 'Onions cook more quickly than potatoes.'),
	(128965, 997208, 'tatoeba', 'この惨状はあなたのせいですか？', 'Are you responsible for this mess?'),
	(128966, 792573, 'tatoeba', '幾人かの被害者は大津波を観測して目を覆うような惨状だったと思っているそうです。', 'It is said that several victims of the tsunami think that the devastation they saw was the kind that made you cover your eyes.'),
	(128967, 794606, 'tatoeba', '今年は亡き母の忌中のため盂蘭盆供養会はないが、先祖の墓の掃除に行く。', 'This year there isn\'t a bon festival memorial ceremony for my departed mother, but I will go to clean my ancestors\' graves.'),
	(128968, 823276, 'tatoeba', '東電は高濃度の放射性物質を含む汚染水の流出を防ぐことができない。', 'TEPCO is unable to stop the flow of dirty water contaminated with highly radioactive material.'),
	(128969, 2252928, 'tatoeba', '春眠暁を覚えず。', 'In spring, one sleeps a sleep that knows no dawn.'),
	(128970, 826712, 'tatoeba', '国務省で働いている。', 'I work in the State Department.'),
	(128971, 11508531, 'tatoeba', '入れ墨入れてるの？', 'Do you have any tattoos?'),
	(128972, 11763473, 'tatoeba', 'それって、本当の入れ墨？', 'Is that a real tattoo?'),
	(128973, 11052441, 'tatoeba', '体中、入れ墨だらけだった。', 'His body was covered with tattoos.'),
	(128974, 828730, 'tatoeba', 'ここに印鑑を押して下さい。', 'Please put your seal here.'),
	(128975, 3193627, 'tatoeba', 'こちらに印鑑かサインをお願いします。', 'Your seal or signature here, please.'),
	(128976, 844970, 'tatoeba', '百合子は家具業界への進出を企図している。', 'Yuriko is planning to move into the furniture business.'),
	(128977, 866725, 'tatoeba', '私は自分の祖先を200年遡ることができる。', 'I can trace my ancestors back 200 years.'),
	(128978, 866751, 'tatoeba', 'お腹が空いたから、私は何か食べるものを仕入れに行くよ。', 'I\'m hungry, so I\'m going to get something to eat.'),
	(128979, 868167, 'tatoeba', '子供はみんな異邦人だ。', 'Children are all foreigners.'),
	(128980, 2242424, 'tatoeba', '紫色のセーターより灰色のセーターの方が好きです。', 'The gray sweater I like more than the purple.'),
